## 11. Integration checklist

- [ ] Every operation has explicit timeouts and an overall execution budget.
- [ ] One owner coordinates retries and session renewal follows the existing contract.
- [ ] Replay eligibility is based on operation semantics, not only status codes.
- [ ] Cancellation propagates through request execution and waiting.
- [ ] Breaker scope, concurrency, failure classification, cooldown, and probes are documented.
- [ ] The approved SDK's actual API and version are confirmed before integration.
- [ ] Cache, freshness, and unknown-write states have intentional presentation.
- [ ] Tests cover transitions, concurrency, cancellation, and session changes.
- [ ] Diagnostics distinguish outcomes and contain only permitted attributes.

